    "corrective_alternative": "open",
    "notice_days": "immediate",
    "serious_injury_recall": null,
    "quote": "When any model exceeds 8 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a rolling 12-month period, the manufacturer shall promptly report the rate and supporting information to the regulator and notify affected customers of the elevated rate and recommended precautions. The regulator shall promptly assess the risk and require a recall unless it documents that an alternative remedy protects customers and the public equally or better."
   }
